    S["email_body"]=function(){return "Good day, [pc.name]!\n\nI checked into an apartment on Tavros Station and took some time for myself. I’ve begun eating a proper breakfast again and I’ve spent my week decompressing. I started wearing different clothes and I’ve given all my old ones a proper clean. I even started talking to my old coworkers, I haven’t connected with some of them in years. This wasn’t easy for me, slowing down, but I feel stronger for it. This is thanks to you for looking after me.\n\nWhenever you’re ready, I’m going to wait on Tavros’ Residential Deck. Like I said before, when we speak again let’s talk about ’us’, okay? I’ll be happy to hear whatever you have to say, no matter how you feel.\n\nUntil then, [pc.name]. Thank you for caring about me. And, I have one small request. If you see me before I see you, try to think of a nonverbal way to start the conversation. I already have my own idea.\n\n-Bianca";};
